---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { items } from '../data/items';

const arrows = items.filter((i) => i.category === 'Arrow');
---

<Layout
  title="Stand Out Arrows – Mysterious, Lucky, Bizarre Rates & Crafting | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Complete guide to all Stand Arrows in Roblox STAND OUT. Learn how to craft Lucky Arrows and Bizarre Arrows, use Part 3/5 focus arrows, and optimize gacha pulls."
  canonicalPath="stand-arrows"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Stand Arrows' }]}
  schemaType="CollectionPage"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-emerald-200">
        <span>Gacha Mechanics &amp; Recipes</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>6 Arrow Types</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Stand Out Arrows &amp; Crafting Guide
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Stand Arrows are the core progression catalysts in Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong>. From basic meteorite arrows to specialized Part focus arrows, this guide covers crafting recipes, token shop costs, and drop rules.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Arrow Types Catalog -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      {arrows.map((arrow) => (
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-400 transition-all">
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 p-2 mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
              <img
                src={arrow.image || '/images/arrows/mysterious-arrow.webp'}
                alt={arrow.name}
                class="w-full h-full object-contain"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900">{arrow.name}</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              {arrow.description}
            </p>

            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 block mb-1">Obtain Method:</span>
              <p class="text-slate-600">{arrow.obtainMethod}</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 block mb-1.5">
              Key Properties &amp; Uses:
            </span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-xs text-slate-600">
              {arrow.uses.map((u) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-1.5">
                  <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">•</span>
                  <span>{u}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Crafting Walkthrough -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Arrow Crafting Station Formulas</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Upgrading to Lucky &amp; Bizarre Arrows</h3>
          <p class="mb-2">
            Never roll basic Mysterious Arrows if hunting for top tiers. Save and merge them at any town Crafting Station:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 font-semibold text-slate-800">
            <li><strong>Lucky Arrow:</strong> 3x Mysterious Arrows</li>
            <li><strong>Bizarre Arrow:</strong> 9x Mysterious Arrows</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Crafting Focus Arrows (Part 3 &amp; Part 5)</h3>
          <p class="mb-2">
            To target Star Platinum, The World, or King Crimson without dilution from Parts 4, 6, 7, 8, and 9:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 font-semibold text-slate-800">
            <li><strong>Part 3 Arrow:</strong> 5x Steel Ingot + 1x Mysterious Arrow</li>
            <li><strong>Part 5 Arrow:</strong> 5x Steel Ingot + 1x Mysterious Arrow</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
